>	Forgive me for sounding ignorant, but what exactly is poly-piling?
>I've seen references to it a lot on the net but I'm not sure what it is
>and how to do it. Could someone shed some light on the subject?
>					
>					Dan.

	Poly-piling is where you take a LOT of objects and drop them on the
same spot (creating a pile) and then zap the pile with a wand of polymrph.
Each object can be transformed into another object of the same type.

Hope it helps.


